# ----------------------------------------
# Monorepo ignore rules
# ----------------------------------------

# Exclude other monorepo projects
backend/
website/
admin-dashboard/
docs/
graphify-out/
.agents/
.github/

# Exclude root files
/*.md
/*.json
/*.yml
/*.zip
/*.keystore

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
node_modules/

# Native folders (managed expo project)
**/android/
**/ios/

# Expo / build artifacts
**/.expo/
**/.expo-shared/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/web-build/
**/.next/

# IDE
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# Git
.git/

# OS
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Env
**/.env*

# App artifacts
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.ipa
